RESEARCH SOFTWARE NOTICE

This project is research software for a simulated 6-DOF powered-descent
vehicle.  It is released for reproducibility and for teaching/portfolio use.
It is NOT flight software, it has not been validated against hardware, and it
carries no warranty of fitness for any purpose.  See LIMITATIONS.md for the
full statement of scope, and do not use it to command a real vehicle.
